ducing it at lower than wild  type levels  and so we can study the  responses of cars targeting these  different cell lines  and when we look at in vitro inner found  gamma production  we see that the myriad car t cells very  similar to human cars are affected  and the number of cells capable of  producing inner frown gamma in response  to low antigen density stimulation  and we very much look forward to using  this model system to further interrogate  the in vivo biology of car t cells  responding to low density target engines  so i would like to thank  the lab roots organizers for having me  today i would also like to thank the  frey lab particularly terry  as well as that walsh a previous member  of the lab who generated some of the  data i showed you today  i'd like to thank the kohler lab  particularly eric for his help and input  on this project  as well as terry's funding sources thank  you very much

